  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7drVSWp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"640\"></p>\n<p><strong>更多玩家模型（More Player Models）</strong> 是角色扮演（RP）的必备模组！无论是托尔金/《指环王》、《哈利·波特》、奇幻、动漫、兽迷、小体型/家庭向，还是其他任何题材，都能满足你的需求！</p>\n<hr>\n<h4><strong>模型特性：<br></strong></h4>\n<p>🐖 变成任意生物！<br> 🧟 通过 F12 菜单更改你的角色模型！<br> 🕷️ 支持多人联机！安装了 MPM 的其他玩家也能看到你的自定义模型！<br> 🦙 此外，请安装 <u>Bukkit 插件</u> 以支持 Java 版服务器的多人联机功能！</p>\n<hr>\n<h4><strong>其他特性：</strong></h4>\n<p>😀 表情动画！（/sit, /dance, /wave, /sleep, /hug, /cry, /angry, /bow, /wag, /crawl 等）<br> 💬 聊天气泡！<br> ℹ️ 鼠标悬停时显示当前手持物品的工具提示！<br>⛏️ 将快捷栏中的第一个物品收起后，它会挂在你背后！</p>\n<hr>\n<h4><strong>更多信息：<br></strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fmoreplayermodels%252ffaq\" rel=\"nofollow\">动画</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fmoreplayermodels%252finstallation\" rel=\"nofollow\">安装指南</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fmoreplayermodels%252fchangelog\" rel=\"nofollow\">更新日志</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fmoreplayermodels%252fcreation\" rel=\"nofollow\">角色创建</a></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fmoreplayermodels%252fscaling\" rel=\"nofollow\">缩放</a></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fmoreplayermodels%252fhead\" rel=\"nofollow\">头部</a></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fmoreplayermodels%252fbody\" rel=\"nofollow\">身体</a></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fmoreplayermodels%252farms\" rel=\"nofollow\">手臂</a></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.kodevelopment.nl%252fminecraft%252fmoreplayermodels%252flegs\" rel=\"nofollow\">腿部</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;如有更多问题，欢迎加入我的 Discord： <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fkodevelopment.nl%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/151785576557707264\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4><strong>支持我：</strong></h4>\n<p>想要支持我吗？成为我的 Patreon 赞助者吧：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Noppes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/S7MWUBK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"552\" height=\"136\"></a></p>",
